WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.261
Kelg-y gom-biis nins nin-kẽem dãmbã sẽn togsd tẽnga pʋga, Fada N'Gurma poorẽ wã.

00:00:07.341 --> 00:00:17.171
A sɩngame ne wakat ning nebã sẽn da pa tar rĩmã, la zak fãa ra tũuda a meng noyã, la no-koeemdã ra pa sa ye.

00:00:17.251 --> 00:00:21.759
B yeelame tɩ daar a ye, savalã zugu, yĩngr pukame.

00:00:21.839 --> 00:00:26.347
Ned a yen n sigame ne a tũud-n-taasã la a paoongã.

00:00:26.427 --> 00:00:29.284
A yʋʋr boondame t'a Diaba Lompo.

00:00:29.364 --> 00:00:32.404
Bãngdbã pa wʋmd a waoongã võor ye.

00:00:32.484 --> 00:00:37.359
B fãa tara b toor-toore, la yaa woto la kibayã maandã.

00:00:37.439 --> 00:00:44.883
Sã n yaa ne Mossi rãmbã, b yeelame t'a yaa Yennenga kom-pugli la Rialé wã bi-ribl.

00:00:44.963 --> 00:00:47.177
Tẽngã nebã ra zoe-a lame.

00:00:47.257 --> 00:00:50.572
La a Diaba Lompo ka wa n na n zab ye.

00:00:50.652 --> 00:00:57.179
B yeelame t'a ra kelgdame, n kaood bʋʋd ne yam, la a manegd ned ne a to.

00:00:57.259 --> 00:01:05.254
La wakat bilf pʋgẽ, zak rãmb waame n na n wilg-a-la b zu-loeesã, la a gomdã lebga tõogo.

00:01:05.334 --> 00:01:17.000
B yeelame t'a ra paasa tẽnga, n yãk tẽnga taoor dãmba, n wilg a yagensã sɛbã, la b kõ b kom-bõonegã tɩ b yɩ tẽnga taoor dãmb ye.

00:01:17.080 --> 00:01:20.670
Rẽ n so t'a Gulmu soolmã ra na n dogame.

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:27.552
B yetame tɩ Gulmu rĩm-dãmbã yita Diaba Lompo, la b sigla yaa Fada N'Gourma.

00:01:27.632 --> 00:01:34.434
B sã n gomd a Zezi yel-bũndã yelle, b pa gomd ned sẽn yi saasẽ bal yell ye.

00:01:34.514 --> 00:01:45.721
B gomda buud toor-toore yelle, la b gomd bũmb sẽn yaa a yembr ne a taaba, la bũmb ning fãa b sẽn dat n maan to-to wã yelle.

00:01:45.801 --> 00:02:01.412
La yãmb sã n sok nin-kẽem dãmbã, tɩ b bãng tɩ bõn-kãens fãa yaa sɩda, b na n sega, n yeel tɩ: "Sẽn be saasẽ wã yaa kãseng n yɩɩdã, la yel-bũnd sẽn be tõnd sʋka yaa sõama".
